  >>> tf.gather(mat, indices, batch_dims=-1).numpy()
  array([[10, 20, 30],
         [10, 20, 30],
         [10, 20, 30]], dtype=int32)

  See also:

    * `tf.sort`: Sort along an axis.
    * `tf.math.top_k`: A partial sort that returns a fixed number of top values
      and corresponding indices.

